      {
        "factor": "One-day bulk article creation / imports",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "To hit 7,145,000, about 1,007 new articles would need to be created in one day; the forecasts suggest such an event is highly unlikely, updating probability downward."
